<a name="TIMELINE">
<i>Asimov's Science Fiction</i> began publishing in 1977, and
has gone through a number of changes, the major ones being:

<table border=1 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=1 BGCOLOR="#FFFFD0">
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jun 1998</td>
  <td>The format grew an inch taller and a quarter-inch wider.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Apr 1996</td>
  <td>The April double issue was discontinued.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Oct 1993</td>
  <td>The price rose to $2.95 from $2.50.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Nov 1992</td>
  <td>The title of the magazine was changed from
     <i>Isaac Asimov's Science Fiction Magazine</i> to
     <i>Asimov's Science Fiction</i>. This also happened
     to be the tribute edition to Isaac Asimov following
     his death.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Feb 1992</td>
  <td>The current "flimsy" cover was introduced. The
     previous cover had a consistancy like that of a paperback.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Nov 1990</td>
  <td>The magazine started publishing 4-weekly, producing
     double issues for Apr and Nov.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jan 1990</td>
  <td>The price rose to $2.50 from $2.00.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jan 1986</td>
  <td>Gardner Dozois took over as editor.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Oct 1984</td>
  <td>The font and layout of the magazine's title was changed.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>May 1983</td>
  <td>The Table of Contents page took on its present-day
     look. The previous format made it pretty difficult to tell
     what was an article and what was a story, didn't categorize
     the stories by length, and made no mention of poetry.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jan 1983</td>
  <td>Shawna McCarthy took over as editor.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Dec 1982</td>
  <td>The price rose to $1.75 from $1.50.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Mar 1982</td>
  <td>Kathleen Moloney took over as editor.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Apr 1981</td>
  <td>The font and layout of the magazine's title was changed.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Apr 1980</td>
  <td>The price rose to $1.50 from $1.25.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jan 1979</td>
  <td>Started publishing monthly.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Jan-Feb 1978</td>
  <td>Started publishing bimonthly.</td>
</tr>
<tr align=left>
  <td>Spring 1977</td>
  <td>First issue, with George H. Scithers as the founding editor; published quarterly.</td>
</tr>
</table>

